# Logseq EDN

## Section

```elixir
blocks = 
  Path.join(:code.priv_dir(:logseq_edn), "logseq_db_UTM Projects_1785234007.edn")
  |> LogseqEdn.parse()
```

```elixir
blocks
|> Enum.filter(fn {_, v} -> v[:"block/title"] == "Domain" end)

root_tag = LogseqEdn.root_tag(blocks)
```

```elixir
tag_blocks = LogseqEdn.tag_blocks(blocks)
```

```elixir
LogseqEdn.tagged_with!(blocks, ["Entity", "MyPay"])
```

```elixir
tagged = LogseqEdn.tagged_with!(blocks, ["Entity", "MyPay"])
tree = LogseqEdn.tree(blocks, tagged)
```

```elixir
tree = LogseqEdn.tree(blocks, [blocks[283]])
LogseqEdn.to_markdown(tree)
|> Kino.Markdown.new()
```

```elixir
domains = LogseqEdn.tagged_with!(blocks, ["Domain", "MyPay"])
entities = LogseqEdn.tagged_with!(blocks, ["Entity", "MyPay"])
terms = LogseqEdn.tagged_with!(blocks, ["Term", "MyPay"])

domains_md = 
  LogseqEdn.tree(blocks, domains)
  |> LogseqEdn.to_markdown()

entities_md = 
  LogseqEdn.tree(blocks, entities)
  |> LogseqEdn.to_markdown()

terms_md = 
  LogseqEdn.tree(blocks, terms)
  |> LogseqEdn.to_markdown()

Kino.Markdown.new("""
## Terms

#{terms_md}

## Domains

#{domains_md}

## Entities

#{entities_md}
""")
```
